00:01:31.978 --> 00:01:33.770
MATT LEONARD: Yeah, I
mean cloud has really

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:37.400
transformed the way that people
think about infrastructure.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:38.840
Gone is a traditional
[INAUDIBLE]

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:41.510
process where you're essentially
building out large data centers

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:43.340
that have long life cycles.

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.080
And you're moving
to a world where

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:46.550
anyone can spin up a workload.

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:49.410
And that workload potentially
could have runaway costs,

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:49.910
right?

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:52.040
This is the great
